<title>MEXICO: Mexico stocks climb to 3rd record close this week.</title>
<headline>Mexico stocks climb to 3rd record close this week.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mexican stocks extended earlier gains on Friday, as investors were encouraged by favorable public finances and industrial activity data, traders said.</p>
<p>Preliminary figures showed the leading IPC share index was up 48.31 points, or 1.28 percent, at 3,826.77.</p>
<p>(( --Martin Roberts, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7907))</p>
